Z||000001||TRiAD||06-25-2001||06:26 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Formula88:<BR><B>Just saw Discount Tires webpage. They're offering a free G-Tech Performance Meter when you buy any 4 BFGoodrich H, V, or Z rated tires.  Check it out.<P>It says G-Tech, not G-Tech Pro, so it's probably not the Pro, but hell, if you're getting tires anyway, it's free.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P><BR>Free correction;<BR>there is only one model of GTech, the Pro, and you get one free with a purchase of any SET of specified BFGoodrich tires, from any authorized BFG dealer. <BR>FYI. <P><P>------------------<BR><B><I>Michael ~ triadtuning@hotmail.com</I></B><BR>-----------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/88FieroGTwhitefscustomcroppedmini.jpg"> <BR><I>Photoshop rendering of planned exterior modifications.</I>||||reg||1
